title: The majority stops being an agreement

@lex_tvn_crisis
# prose-audit: Grade A — The August break is built rather than announced: Porozumienie tries to amend the Polish Deal and the media bill before it defects, its OECD compromise is a real offer PiS can take, and whether the coalition survives the week depends on whether Kaczyński still needs Gowin's votes.
call: poland_normalize
title: Porozumienie tries to amend its way out of a rupture
subtitle: Gowin wants the Polish Deal's tax provisions changed and the media bill limited to hostile states; PiS decides whether it still needs him
face-image: img/poland/events/tvp-headquarters.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.lex_tvn_crisis_done = 1;
const kukizAligned = String(Q.kukiz_alignment || "unaligned");
// PiS can afford to refuse Gowin exactly to the extent that it has somewhere
// else to get its votes.
Q.pis_needs_gowin = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, Math.round(
    62 -
    (kukizAligned == "pis_current" ? 34 : 0) -
    (kukizAligned == "toleration" ? 16 : 0) -
    (Q.republikanie_formed ? 10 : 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.gowin_standing) || 45) * 0.2
)));
Q.oecd_compromise_offered = 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "Gowin offers to restrict the media bill to Russia and China and nothing else";
!}

= August 2021 — Two bills and one coalition

Two arguments arrive in the same fortnight and Porozumienie is on the wrong side
of both.

The first is the **Polski Ład**. Gowin has been saying for months that the
health-contribution changes are a tax rise on exactly the people his party
exists to represent — small firms, the self-employed, the provincial middle
class — and that a government which passes it will spend the next two years
explaining it. He is not proposing to vote it down. He is proposing to change
it, which is a different thing and which PiS is not in the habit of allowing.

The second is the media-ownership bill that everyone has already started calling
**Lex TVN**. It would bar controlling stakes held from outside the European
Economic Area, which as drafted means one broadcaster and everybody knows which.
Porozumienie's counter-proposal is genuinely clever: extend the permitted
ownership to the whole OECD. American capital stays, Russian and Chinese capital
is still excluded, and the government keeps a defensible national-security
argument. It is the version PiS would have written if the point were security.

[? if pis_needs_gowin >= 50: Nowogrodzka has to take this seriously, because
without Porozumienie's deputies the chamber does not pass anything. The
negotiation is real and Gowin knows it.?]
[? if pis_needs_gowin < 50: Nowogrodzka does not have to take this seriously
any more. The arithmetic that made Gowin indispensable in April 2020 has been
replaced over eighteen patient months, and the people counting have already
told Kaczyński what he can afford.?]

- @lex_tvn_watch
- @lex_tvn_back_oecd
- @lex_tvn_oppose_both

@lex_tvn_watch
# prose-audit: Grade B — Refusing to help draft a censorship bill is the position most of the Left would take and it leaves the outcome entirely to the governing camp.
title: Refuse to improve a bill we want defeated
subtitle: The clean line; the compromise succeeds or fails without us
on-arrival: {!
Q.lex_tvn_stance = "Defeat, not amend";
Q.progressive_credibility += 3;
Q.media_capacity += 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left refuses to help redraft the media bill";
!}

We are not going to spend a week negotiating which foreign owners a governing
party may expropriate. The bill should fall. If Porozumienie wants to make it
survivable, Porozumienie can explain why.

- @gowin_dismissed

@lex_tvn_back_oecd
# prose-audit: Grade A — Backing the OECD amendment is the route that can actually save TVN's ownership and it is charged honestly: it legitimises the premise that the state gets to choose broadcasters' owners.
title: Vote for the OECD amendment and say why
subtitle: The likeliest way to save TVN; we accept the premise that ownership is the state's business
on-arrival: {!
Q.lex_tvn_stance = "Back the OECD amendment";
Q.oecd_left_support = 1;
Q.gowin_channel = Math.min(100, (Number(Q.gowin_channel) || 0) + 12);
Q.progressive_credibility -= 3;
Q.media_pluralism_defended = 1;
Q.public_trust += 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left votes for a conservative amendment to save a commercial broadcaster";
!}

We hold our noses and vote for it. A bill that lets an American owner keep a
newsroom is a worse bill than no bill and a much better one than the draft, and
the newsroom is real.

Our own people will point out that we have just voted for the principle that
the government picks who may own a television station, and only argued about
the map. They are right, and TVN is still broadcasting.

- @gowin_dismissed

@lex_tvn_oppose_both
# prose-audit: Grade B — Attacking the Polish Deal and the media bill together is the maximal opposition posture and it accelerates the rupture inside the governing camp by removing any incentive for PiS to keep bargaining.
title: Attack the tax package and the media bill together
subtitle: Maximal pressure; PiS stops looking for a compromise with anyone
on-arrival: {!
Q.lex_tvn_stance = "Oppose both";
Q.pis_needs_gowin = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.pis_needs_gowin) || 50) - 8
);
Q.pis_relation -= 4;
Q.progressive_credibility += 2;
Q.media_capacity += 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left campaigns against the tax package and the media law at once";
!}

We put the two together in every appearance: a tax rise on small firms and a
law to take a television station, from a government that has run out of
arguments. It is the strongest political attack available.

It also tells Kaczyński that there is nothing to be gained by conceding
anything to anyone, which shortens the negotiation he was having with Gowin.

- @gowin_dismissed

@gowin_dismissed
# prose-audit: Grade A — The dismissal resolves from whether PiS still needs Gowin rather than from the date, the deputies who follow him out are the ones the chain has been counting since 2020, and the event states which organisations leave the PiS committee and which stay on it.
title: Morawiecki dismisses his deputy
subtitle: Porozumienie leaves the cabinet, the club and the list; Solidarna Polska and Partia Republikańska stay on all three
on-arrival: {!
Q.gowin_dismissed_done = 1;
const needs = Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_needs_gowin) || 50);
// Kaczyński concedes only when the arithmetic leaves him no choice at all.
// Wanting TVN is not a marginal preference inside PiS, so a merely awkward
// count is not enough to buy the amendment.
const oecdAccepted = needs >= 66;
Q.oecd_compromise_accepted = oecdAccepted ? 1 : 0;
const porozumienie = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "porozumienie";
});
const odnowa = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "odnowa";
});
// Paths that skipped the leadership-dispute scene still arrive in August
// with the same twelve-person Porozumienie core. Earlier departures remain in
// the PiS family and therefore cannot disappear from the member ledger.
if (porozumienie && Number(porozumienie.mp_count) > 12) {
    const departedBeforeAugust = Number(porozumienie.mp_count) - 12;
    porozumienie.mp_count = 12;
    porozumienie.sejm_mps = 12;
    const pisParty = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
        return record.id == "pis_party";
    });
    if (pisParty) {
        pisParty.mp_count = Math.max(0, Number(pisParty.mp_count) || 0) +
            departedBeforeAugust;
        pisParty.sejm_mps = pisParty.mp_count;
    }
}
const remaining = Math.max(0, Math.round(
    Number(porozumienie ? porozumienie.mp_count : 11) || 0
));
if (oecdAccepted) {
    // PiS buys another few months by taking the amendment.
    Q.gowin_expelled = 0;
    Q.united_right_cohesion = Math.min(
        100,
        (Number(Q.united_right_cohesion) || 45) + 6
    );
    Q.media_pluralism_defended = 1;
    Q.lex_tvn_result = "amended";
    Q.news_headline =
        "PiS accepts the OECD amendment and keeps its coalition another season";
} else {
    Q.gowin_expelled = 1;
    Q.gowin_in_cabinet = 0;
    Q.porozumienie_exit_done = 1;
    Q.lex_tvn_result = "pending";
    // The deputies who follow him out are the ones recorded as his since 2020;
    // the rest choose the government and become OdNowa.
    // His own tendency, plus whichever mediators a stronger leader can still
    // carry. A destroyed Gowin leaves with almost nobody.
    const loyalToGowin = Math.max(2, Math.min(
        remaining - 1,
        Math.round(
            Math.max(2, Number(Q.porozumienie_rebel_mps) || 5) +
            (Math.max(0, Number(Q.gowin_standing) || 45) - 45) / 22 +
            Math.max(0, Number(Q.porozumienie_mediator_mps) || 0) * 0.4
        )
    ));
    const staying = Math.max(0, remaining - loyalToGowin);
    Q.porozumienie_seats = loyalToGowin;
    Q.porozumienie_active = loyalToGowin > 0 ? 1 : 0;
    Q.odnowa_seats = staying;
    Q.odnowa_formed = staying > 0 ? 1 : 0;
    Q.pis_seats = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.pis_seats) || 235) - loyalToGowin);
    Q.government_support_seats = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.government_support_seats) || 235) - loyalToGowin
    );
    Q.porozumienie_status =
        "Gowin-led opposition party outside the United Right";
    Q.porozumienie_list_committee = "porozumienie";
    Q.united_right_cohesion = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.united_right_cohesion) || 45) - 12
    );
    Q.government_coalition_dissent =
        (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 0) + 16;
    if (porozumienie) {
        // All five affiliations move together here, which is what makes this
        // different from every earlier beat in the chain.
        porozumienie.active = loyalToGowin > 0 ? 1 : 0;
        porozumienie.allied = 0;
        porozumienie.independent = 1;
        porozumienie.in_cabinet = 0;
        porozumienie.support_mode = "opposition";
        porozumienie.club = "porozumienie";
        porozumienie.list_committee = "porozumienie";
        porozumienie.legal_status = "independent parliamentary party";
        porozumienie.mp_count = loyalToGowin;
        porozumienie.sejm_mps = loyalToGowin;
        porozumienie.exclusive_seats = loyalToGowin;
        porozumienie.relation = Math.min(
            100,
            (Number(porozumienie.relation) || 22) + 10
        );
        porozumienie.electoral_outside_option =
            "a centre-right committee it does not yet have";
    }
    if (odnowa && staying > 0) {
        odnowa.active = 1;
        odnowa.allied = 1;
        odnowa.independent = 1;
        // A new party that never leaves the list, the club or the government.
        odnowa.list_committee = "pis";
        odnowa.club = "pis";
        odnowa.support_mode = "coalition";
        odnowa.in_cabinet = 1;
        odnowa.legal_status = "allied party inside the United Right";
        odnowa.mp_count = staying;
        odnowa.sejm_mps = staying;
        odnowa.exclusive_seats = 0;
        odnowa.organisation = 22;
        odnowa.cohesion = 70;
        odnowa.relation = 2;
        odnowa.electoral_outside_option = "protected places on the PiS list";
    }
    const followers = [
        "gowin", "sroka", "wypij", "bukowiec", "michalek", "strzezek"
    ];
    const stayers = ["ociepa", "murdzek", "piechowiak", "dabrowska_banaszek"];
    for (const record of (Q.rival_person_records || [])) {
        if (followers.includes(record.id)) {
            record.party = "porozumienie";
            record.organisation = "porozumienie";
            record.loyalty = "Gowin";
            record.status = "Porozumienie MP";
        } else if (stayers.includes(record.id) && staying > 0) {
            record.party = "pis";
            record.organisation = "odnowa";
            record.loyalty = "United Right first";
            record.status = "OdNowa RP MP";
        }
    }
    // Leaving the government means leaving the offices. Whatever Porozumienie
    // still held on the morning of 11 August is a PiS portfolio by the evening.
    const pisSuccessors = {
        housing: "Piotr Uściński", science: "Przemysław Czarnek",
        economy: "Piotr Nowak", labor: "Marlena Maląg",
        digital: "Janusz Cieszyński"
    };
    for (const portfolio of [
        "labor", "equality", "housing", "health", "digital", "science",
        "interior", "finance", "economy", "justice", "foreign",
        "agriculture", "defence"
    ]) {
        if (Q[portfolio + "_minister_party"] != "Porozumienie") continue;
        Q[portfolio + "_minister"] =
            pisSuccessors[portfolio] || "PiS departmental nominee";
        Q[portfolio + "_minister_party"] = "PiS";
    }
    Q.news_headline =
        "Morawiecki dismisses Gowin; Porozumienie leaves the United Right";
}
!}

= The dismissal

[? if oecd_compromise_accepted = 1: Kaczyński takes the amendment. The media
bill is redrawn around the OECD, which keeps American ownership lawful and
keeps the security argument intact, and the Polish Deal's health contribution
acquires a threshold that Porozumienie can describe as a victory. Gowin stays
in the cabinet. The United Right survives the summer for the plainest possible
reason: the government still cannot count to a majority without him, and
Kaczyński would rather concede a paragraph than test that.?]
[? if oecd_compromise_accepted = 0: Mateusz Morawiecki dismisses his deputy
prime minister. The OECD amendment is refused; the tax package goes ahead
unchanged; Gowin is out of the government by the afternoon and out of the
United Right by the evening, and this time he takes his party with him.
**[+ porozumienie_seats +]** deputies follow him onto the opposition benches
and out of the electoral committee they were elected on. **[+ odnowa_seats +]**
do not: **Marcin Ociepa** and the deputies around him register **OdNowa RP**,
which is a new party, an independent organisation and — like Partia
Republikańska before it and Solidarna Polska since 2019 — a component of the
PiS list, the PiS club and the PiS government. Nothing about being your own
party has ever obliged you to leave any of the three. The governing camp
finishes the day with roughly two hundred and twenty-seven dependable votes and
a majority that has to be assembled before every difficult bill.?]

- @august_11_sejm
- @lex_tvn_amended_close

