@aug11_press_kukiz
# prose-audit: Grade A — Using the afternoon to bid for Kukiz rather than to condemn him is the route that changes the following two years, and it spends credibility to do it.
title: Get into the corridor while the bargaining is live
subtitle: Requires an existing relationship; the best chance of turning his votes later
choose-if: kukiz_channel >= 15
unavailable-subtitle: His deputies are not taking our calls this afternoon.
on-arrival: {!
Q.kukiz_channel = Math.min(100, (Number(Q.kukiz_channel) || 0) + 14);
Q.kukiz_programme_credit =
    (Number(Q.kukiz_programme_credit) || 0) + 10;
Q.progressives_dissent += 4;
Q.progressive_credibility -= 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "Left whips are seen outside the Kukiz circle's room during the break";
!}

While the government is in there offering committee dates, we are in the
corridor offering the same committee dates plus the votes to actually carry
them, which is a thing PiS cannot offer because PiS controls the committee and
has never once let it sit.

It looks appalling in photographs. It is also the only reason that, in a year's
time, there is a version of the anti-corruption bill with our name on it and
his signature under it.

